CLASS LHC_ZR_Z2604TRAVEL DEFINITION INHERITING FROM CL_ABAP_BEHAVIOR_HANDLER.
  PRIVATE SECTION.
    METHODS:
      GET_GLOBAL_AUTHORIZATIONS FOR GLOBAL AUTHORIZATION
        IMPORTING
           REQUEST requested_authorizations FOR ZrZ2604travel
        RESULT result.

        METHODS setInitialStatus
            FOR DETERMINE ON SAVE
            IMPORTING keys FOR ZRZ2604TRAVEL~setInitialStatus.
ENDCLASS.

CLASS LHC_ZR_Z2604TRAVEL IMPLEMENTATION.
  METHOD GET_GLOBAL_AUTHORIZATIONS.
  ENDMETHOD.

  METHOD setInitialStatus.
    MODIFY ENTITIES OF ZR_Z2604TRAVEL IN LOCAL MODE
    ENTITY ZRZ2604TRAVEL
    UPDATE FIELDS ( Status )
    WITH VALUE #(
        FOR key IN keys
        (
        %tky = key-%tky
        status = 'N'
        )
    ).

  ENDMETHOD.

ENDCLASS.